      "text": "A page from a CVSource (投中信息) Chinese-language investment-research report headed \"港交所主板账面退出回报最高\" (HKEX main board has the highest book exit return). A red rectangle covers the opening paragraph and the exit-analysis table; a bar-and-line chart below tracks VC/PE penetration of IPOs from 2024-04 to 2025-04.",
